| **Scalability** | 5/10 | Single-threaded gRPC workers. No caching. No rate limiting on LLM calls. No queue for uploads. |
| **Production Readiness** | 4/10 | Secrets in .env committed to repo. No auth. No rate limiting. No health checks beyond basic. CORS wide open. |
| **Maintainability** | 7/10 | Good separation of concerns. Clean prompt modularization. Provider factory is well done. |
| **Observability** | 6/10 | Winston logging with rotation is solid. Telemetry capture exists. No metrics export. No tracing. No dashboards. |
| **Security** | 3/10 | API keys in committed .env files. No authentication. No authorization. Open CORS. No input length limits on chat. |
| **Overall** | **5.5/10** | Strong foundation, not production-ready. The retrievalâ†’generation pipeline needs fundamental work. |

