### IMP-6: Contradiction Detection Service Routes Through the Chat LLM Pipeline

> **Issue**: The contradiction detection service sends its analysis prompts through the same gRPC LLM pipeline that handles user chat â€” including all the chat-specific prompt modules, formatting contracts, and sanitization.

**Evidence from code**:
- [contradictionDetectionService.js L134](../apps/api-gateway/services/contradictionDetectionService.js#L134): `const llmResult = await getLLMResponse({...})`
